# No AI git attribution

Never add Cursor, an agent, or any AI tool as a git author, co-author, or contributor.

- Forbidden: `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `cursoragent@cursor.com`, and AI credits in AUTHORS, CONTRIBUTING, or release notes.
- After every `git commit`, run `git log -1 --format='%B'`. If a wrapper injected a Cursor trailer, rewrite with `git commit-tree` (not `git commit --amend`).
- Commits belong to Dirk / NOOBBase only.
